  "text": "`OnlyValidArgs` strips any embedded description before validation. In [`args.go`, lines 54–58], it splits each `ValidArgs` entry at the first tab (`strings.Split(v, \"\\t\")[0]`) and keeps only the argument portion. It then compares positional arguments against those stripped values (`args.go`, lines 59–63). Thus, an entry like `\"foo\\tdescription\"` validates `\"foo\"`, not the full string.",
